+## 5. Student Information Section
+
+Displays basic identity and academic profile (from `01_Product_Overview.md` §10):
+
+- Name
+- Student number
+- Entry year
+- Major and orientation
+- Study type
+- Assigned curriculum
+
+Read-only on the dashboard. Editing happens through profile management (§20).
